[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148664965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109269#issuecomment-3148664965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109269","id":3148664965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67rNCF","user":{"login":"brcontainer","id":4368952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjg5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4368952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer","html_url":"https://github.com/brcontainer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brcontainer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-03T20:00:57Z","updated_at":"2025-08-03T20:00:57Z","body":"I don't know if this information makes any difference, but the error only occurs until the extra final line is added—which, by default, the Godot editor automatically does when saving the script. As soon as this line is inserted, the error disappears.\n\nI agree that this is a bug, but I mention it because, under normal conditions, the problem doesn't occur. Even when using an external editor that doesn't automatically insert the line break, it doesn't affect the build or export—the project continues to function normally. The error appears to be limited to the moment of typing and disappears as soon as the file is saved (when the line break is added).\n\nHere I forced an external editor to keep the script without the final line break:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tready.connect(func(): OS.alert(\"test\", \"test\"))\n```\n\n<img width=\"733\" height=\"898\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0a3be95-0857-48c1-927e-258c98296efa\" />\n\nI exported the project, and it ran without any issues:\n\n<img width=\"476\" height=\"375\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59d0d575-710f-4c99-ad19-660d71334f25\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3148664965/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5028644204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109269#issuecomment-5028644204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109269","id":5028644204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK7sFbA","user":{"login":"CoolStopCode","id":177484248,"node_id":"U_kgDOCpQx2A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177484248?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode","html_url":"https://github.com/CoolStopCode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CoolStopCode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://ap